<div class="report-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Global Fuel Price Trends &amp; Policy Impact Analysis<br>(2020–2026)</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">A comprehensive trend analysis of retail fuel prices across 84 countries, examining the interplay between Brent Crude benchmarks, taxation, subsidies, and regional economic conditions over a six-year period.</p>
    <div class="meta">
      <span>84 Countries</span>
      <span>7 Regions</span>
      <span>Jan 2020 – Apr 2026</span>
      <span>27,468 Weekly Observations</span>
      <span>3 Fuel Types</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">

<!-- ====== TOC ====== -->
<nav class="toc">
  <h2>Contents</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#global-overview">Global Fuel Price Overview</a></li>
