    <li><a href="#regional-comparison">Regional Price Disparities</a></li>
    <li><a href="#subsidy-tax-analysis">Impact of Subsidies and Taxation on Retail Prices</a></li>
    <li><a href="#income-level">Fuel Affordability by Income Level</a></li>
    <li><a href="#key-findings">Key Findings &amp; Policy Implications</a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<!-- ====== SECTION 1: GLOBAL OVERVIEW ====== -->
<section id="global-overview">
  <h2 class="section-title">1. Global Fuel Price Overview</h2>
  <p class="section-obj">High-level summary statistics and the Brent Crude baseline across the full study period.</p>

